desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Ssl Mode No Verify"
	title_zh: "Ssl Mode No Verify"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-ssl-mode-no-verify"
	risk: "certificate-validation"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Detected SSL that will accept an unverified connection. This makes the connections susceptible to man-in-the-middle attacks. Use 'OpenSSL::SSL::VERIFY_PEER' instead.

### 风险类型
证书校验缺失（certificate-validation）

### 影响
未正确校验 TLS 证书或关闭了证书校验，中间人攻击者可窃听或篡改通信。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-295: Improper Certificate Validation
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
启用并严格校验证书链、主机名和有效期，禁止在生产环境关闭校验。

推荐修复：
Use 'OpenSSL::SSL::VERIFY_PEER' instead.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.rb": <<<POS
OpenSSL::SSL::VERIFY_NONE
POS
	"safefile://pos.rb": <<<NEG
OpenSSL::SSL::VERIFY_PEER
NEG
)

${*.rb}.pattern_regex(/(?:OpenSSL::SSL::VERIFY_NONE)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Ssl Mode No Verify",
	title_zh: "Ssl Mode No Verify",
	message: "Ssl Mode No Verify detected.",
}
